SUMMARY:Hirut Hoot Comedy: 14th Anniversary Show
DESCRIPTION:Holy mackinaw! Where has the time gone? The answer to this and may other questions will be provided at our 14th Anniversary Show! What is 14 years? The Charcoal Briquette? Sounds about right. Well\, check out this insane comedy all star lineup: \nCarolyn Bennett \nEvan Carter \nTodd Graham \nJude Klassen \nAndrew Lizotte \nSimon Rakoff \nGeorge Westerholm \na usual array of videos \nAll hosted by Kevin MacDonald \nJust $20 and you\, our devoted fans! \nCELEBRATE WITH US!
